FtJTIwJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.3","title":"The Codex","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A documentary filmmaker, Pathi tries to decipher the codex required to open the box. While Anu continues to struggle in the village, more people arrive with different agendas to get the box.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uYyrbr8RlayjJ2Nzfe6tUZpr00q.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9BaW5kaGFtJTIwVmVkaGFtJTIwJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.4","title":"Bheeja Mantra","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The group of visitors manage to open the box but are shocked to find what it contains. An unexpected visitor and a shocking death make Anu nervous about the future. She also comes across a prophecy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nGVoWNX2QbQfPhGNGxm9qDgldFS.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9BaW5kaGFtJTIwVmVkaGFtJTIwJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.5","title":"Deciphering The Codex","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pathi is surprised by his son Vikas’s deciphering skills as he tries to solve the codex. Anu and her father discuss the village’s past. More people discover the 3D prototype of the box.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lcO9kOmFapjwUzOzzcMtodZXXh2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9BaW5kaGFtJTIwVmVkaGFtJTIwJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.6","title":"Future Written In The Past","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The village comes under Interpol's radar. Pathi realises that the inscriptions on the box can help in solving all the mysteries. Anu gets a vision in her sleep, which changes her perception.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mHnB7gGvVXC0P08slgtLYhHy7Pg.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9BaW5kaGFtJTIwVmVkaGFtJTIwJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.7","title":"The Riddle","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Anu finds the key to the temple. Pathi uses Vikas’s help in deciphering the codex. The gateway to the chamber is found but the Fifth Veda is missing!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h8eHc6w1KYQUSMH2dCXQZwDTUpt.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9BaW5kaGFtJTIwVmVkaGFtJTIwJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.8","title":"The Fifth Veda","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The group is still coming to terms with the chamber’s secrets. While they try to find the missing Veda, Anu realises that the village prophecy means that she is the key to unveiling the Fifth Veda.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xpxKS9lyWNKx6HCBJCjTVnbKAXs.jpg"}]}}